ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","color":"446699","default":false,"description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-03-08T06:53:31Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T05:44:31Z","closed_at":"2025-03-09T14:11:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103794","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103794.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103794.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-09T14:11:35Z"},"body":"The aim of this PR is to reduce memory allocations, not necessarily to increase performance. But it does have a nice performance increase as well. \r\n\r\nIn last week's core meeting we agreed that we should work towards reducing per-frame memory allocations as much as possible. Both for performance and stability.\r\n\r\nResults using the Legend of the Nuku Warriors demo with tons of omnilights.\r\n\r\n_Before: ~95,000 allocations per second: 31-32 mspf_\r\n![Screenshot (405)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37741b3d-0460-4731-bc1b-d71beb313c45)\r\n\r\n_After: ~45,000 allocations per second: 29-30 mspf_\r\n![Screenshot (409)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ea6e721-87f4-45f5-8ddb-d0c31539d387)\r\n\r\nThe most important changes here are:\r\n1. Use a thread_local LocalVector instead of a Vector. This removes the allocations from the frequent use of `push_back()`\r\n2. Cache uniform sets instead of recreating every frame. `uniform_set_create()` allocates a lot of memory. \r\n\r\nThere is a lot more that can be done. But this PR contains a very safe, very impactful set of optimizations. So I would prefer to merge this quickly and then to move on to the other places.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103794/reactions","total_count":44,"+1":14,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":10,"rocket":20,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103794/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}